/* The pause box (utils2.c: handlePause, createPauseBox): Start freezes the game and a small box saying "Pause" sits
   in the middle of the screen until Start is pressed again. Placement, whatever the skin: the original's box at -26,
   -14, 56 x 24 from the screen's centre (US version), x 134 to 190 and y 106 to 130 of its 320 x 240 screen. One
   pixel of the original is 3dp. The skins give it its look. */

/* Over every other document, menus included: the original draws it last (pauseFrame). */
body {
	width: 100%;
	height: 100%;
	pointer-events: none;
	z-index: 100;
}

#box {
	position: absolute;
	left: 50%;
	top: 318dp;
	width: 168dp;
	height: 72dp;
	margin-left: -78dp;
	text-align: center;
	line-height: 66dp;
	border: 3dp #c9d3de;
	border-radius: 8dp;
	background-color: #1a1f27e0;
}
